OL,5,
OL,6,FAikman, who plays Rachel Duffy in
OL,7,FLiverpool crime drama This City is
OL,8,FOurs, told BBC Wales Lucy Owen she did
OL,9,Fnot even tell her parents about her
OL,10,Fcrucial role in the show.
